  "_note": "DMV under ZDMV-1, in force since 1 January 2021: three separate amounts — one for CO2 and fuel, one for engine power, one for the emission standard — added together and then reduced for the age of the car. Since 2021 it is not a percentage of the price, and the price does not enter it at all. Every figure here is from the enacted text in Uradni list RS 200/2020, cross-checked against the FURS guidance of 5 September 2025; the numbers in the 2020 bill were different and wrong. The emission standard is on the car's papers; we derive it from the year of first registration and take the older side of each boundary, so the tax is never understated.",
